Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 04:14:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] packages: add AmneziaWG (kmod-amneziawg, amneziawg-tools,
 luci-proto-amneziawg)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

AmneziaWG 3.1 — obfuscated WireGuard fork (DPI-resistant).
Packages from 2Grey/awg-openwrt; kmod builds against the local
kernel (6.12.112 with PEJIR01 config) so it installs cleanly.
User-facing config via LuCI Network->Interfaces (proto awg).
